          "span_id": "span_assert_preference_subjective",
          "support_type": "body",
          "text": "It sounds like you're just a bass head, which is fine, but you have to understand that sound is subjective and you don't have \"normal\" (no insult intended) audio preferences that would line up with the majority of the public (again no insult) which is fine.",
