          "evidence_id": "assert_speaker_preference_scope",
          "span_id": "span_assert_preference_position",
          "support_type": "body",
          "text": "I found speakers with a basic subwoofer to sound better than any of my headphones. It's a different beast entirely, headphones don't have true soundstage, the bass you can feel from your entire body is always better than just hearing and feeling with the ears. The biggest reason I love headphones is the comfort and accuracy. With a speaker even turning my head changes the sound to a point where I'd rather use a headphone.",
